WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:07.788
Also there is a little bit of racialism
in American Sahaja Yogis,

2
00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:12.560
which I will cut out and out,
which is nonsense.

3
00:00:13.003 --> 00:00:18.560
Racialism must be fought completely.
That’s the greatest curse

4
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:23.360
you have in the West.
Especially in America,

5
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.282
people like George Washington,
people like Abraham Lincoln,

6
00:00:28.972 --> 00:00:32.720
they have lost their lives
because of this racialism.

7
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.360
We have to know that our differences
are only skin deep,

8
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.449
and if you are skin deep Sahaja Yogis,
you are not Sahaja Yogis.

9
00:00:42.588 --> 00:00:50.056
You have to be Kundalini deep.
Unless and until you develop that,

10
00:00:50.331 --> 00:00:56.748
this racialism will continue.
And that’s the worst curse we have.

11
00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:11.336
I don’t know from where it has come,
this racist feeling,

12
00:01:12.357 --> 00:01:17.920
but you know Hitler,
he worked on this and what he did,

13
00:01:18.169 --> 00:01:23.142
so how dangerous it is,
how cruel it is.

14
00:01:27.066 --> 00:01:36.729
Absolutely it’s the most dangerous thing.
But now Germans have learned a lesson.

15
00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:49.000
At least German Sahaja Yogis
and Austrian Sahaja Yogis are better.

16
00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.600
Of course there are many Germans
in Austria who are still

17
00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:58.141
being very racists and supportive.
Remember that if you have

18
00:01:58.141 --> 00:02:02.680
any racialism in your head,
you are a part of Hitler’s state.

19
00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:10.422
This is one of the greatest conditionings
we have in the West.

20
00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:17.080
Which way you can decide
which race is higher, which race is lower?

21
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.446
Except that one race is dominating,
that’s all we can say, has been.

22
00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:34.320
So, dominating races may go out of
the circulation of evolution completely.

23
00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:40.040
And all that dominating animals
have wiped out.

24
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:49.480
So please remove that from your head,
completely.

25
00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.320
We are all children of one Mother.

26
00:02:54.178 --> 00:02:58.320
My face may be fairer,
but My hands are black.

27
00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.160
That’s the sign of Mahakali also,
one of the signs.

28
00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:09.160
If you read all of the names, there is.
Her hands are black. Face is… All right.

29
00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:14.400
So for all of you I have to warn
that no racialism will work.

30
00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:18.720
Anybody who will try racialism
will go out of Sahaja Yoga completely.

31
00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.520
We don’t want Hitlers in Sahaja Yoga.

32
00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:24.160
Those who try to be like that
by any chance –

33
00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:33.331
so many tried to be Hitlers
in some way or another – all out.

34
00:03:37.267 --> 00:03:41.315
So one has to be careful on that point.

35
00:03:53.610 --> 00:04:00.080
Very surprisingly, Christ was not born
in England or in America.

36
00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:09.513
According to racialism
He should be condemned, isn’t it?

37
00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:14.413
It’s a very funny thing,
which I really can’t understand,

38
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:28.720
how people justify themselves.
All such ideas must be given up.

39
00:04:33.435 --> 00:04:37.840
Any other question if you have,
you come and talk to Me.

40
00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:48.640
Try to understand that this is
the greatest work in spiritual history.

41
00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:52.452
You are used
for the greatest work

42
00:04:52.635 --> 00:05:02.337
and you need a tremendous understanding.
It’s not an ordinary revolution.

43
00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:07.840
I’ve seen a person, anybody, say –
Elvis Presley,

44
00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.249
and all those ordinary people;
just he has some musical talent.

45
00:05:12.249 --> 00:05:17.888
People were just mad after him.
They could do anything for him.

46
00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.887
But Sahaja Yoga which has so much
of gain

47
00:05:22.124 --> 00:05:28.758
so much of blessings,
so much of My love.

48
00:05:30.065 --> 00:05:34.040
We have to give up
our baser ideas.

49
00:05:36.693 --> 00:05:43.000
We cannot be low grade people.

50
00:05:43.814 --> 00:05:47.840
That doesn’t mean
that you should be well educated,

51
00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:56.640
not necessarily, but a kind of a dignity,&nbsp;

52
00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:07.760
understanding,

53
00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:13.760
and fighting these evil forces
are not possible with people

54
00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:19.680
who themselves are negative.

55
00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:24.160
Now we’ve worked a lot in America.
Now lots of people

56
00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.160
are coming in San Diego,
and today there will be many more,

57
00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:39.360
but we have to look after them

58
00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:47.600
and sustain them and develop them,
and for that you need lot of wisdom.

59
00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.748
I hope with this puja
many things will be ignited within you,

60
00:06:51.748 --> 00:06:59.040
and you will be enlightened about
how to manage people slowly and steadily,

61
00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:10.560
and then introduce to them
this ocean of joy.

62
00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:14.640
We have to be above all these things,
all petty things.

63
00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:18.355
Petty mindedness
cannot help Sahaja Yoga.

64
00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:43.600
And the attention is so poor that you know
that on a Sahasrara Day, also,

65
00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.320
there were no flowers.
Mother said there were no flowers

66
00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:52.320
from the whole of America.

67
00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.760
But even if they have
some pain in the head, they write to Me.

68
00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:01.837
From Australia,
from everywhere I got it.

69
00:08:01.837 --> 00:08:05.200
If you are devoted to someone,
if you love someone, if someone loves you,

70
00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:08.000
you see, how can you remain
without wishing that person,

71
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:15.680
I can’t understand.
And you should not wait for any leader

72
00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:20.400
to tell you
that you have to wish your Mother.

73
00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:29.440
This is going to far.

74
00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:39.600
You must understand
the importance of your being there,

75
00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:44.480
and also the importance of the great work
you have taken upon yourself,

76
00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:50.880
your responsibilities.
If you do not understand that,

77
00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:57.200
you are useless as Sahaja Yogis.

78
00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.480
As you know, at this age
I am working so hard,

79
00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:08.800
traveling all the time,
I mean, people give up half way.

80
00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:16.627
For what am I doing it, for Myself?
What is My gain? Nothing.

81
00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:23.080
Sahaja Yoga is for you, and for others,
your brothers and sisters.

82
00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:33.720
There isn’t any sacrifice
involved in that, no asceticism, nothing,

83
00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:40.960
but certain discipline of your soul
should be there,

84
00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:51.440
is to get up, have your baths
and to do your meditation. That’s all.

85
00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:58.240
Look after your ascent.
That is your goal. That’s thing you have to achieve.

86
00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:02.080
As soon as Sahaja Yogis
achieve that depth,

87
00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:07.040
Sahaja Yoga will spread in America,
New York, any city.

88
00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.800
Even one deep person is sufficient.

89
00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:23.120
The other people, those who have gurus,
they go on talking about them

90
00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:27.200
for hours together,
telling fantastic stories.

91
00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.920
May be false, but we don’t talk
about our guru to anyone.

92
00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:37.040
We don’t talk about Sahaja Yoga to anyone.

93
00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:41.520
We have to be bold and brave
and dashing about it.

94
00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:52.560
Then only it will work out.

95
00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:56.000
Now you’re allowed to say
what you like about Me.

96
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:59.040
You’re allowed to say
that I am The Holy Ghost;

97
00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.360
that I am The Holy Ghost
that Christ has sent.

98
00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:09.520
Do what you like. There’s no restriction.
You can talk about the miracles.

99
00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:13.600
You know about the miracle
of the Sahasrara,

100
00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.400
which opened in the photograph
and the whole of Sahasrara has come out

101
00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:30.160
as a white, pinkish color lotuses
and you can see beautiful petals.

102
00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.920
You can also see the kundalini.
You can also see the three forms.

103
00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.800
It’s wonderful.

104
00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:41.360
But surprisingly the photo
in which you see three forms

105
00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:48.000
and you see the breaking, that photo,
when it is enlarged,

106
00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.426
you don’t see the three forms,
only you see the lotus.

107
00:11:51.426 --> 00:12:02.000
Miracles after miracles.
But one must realize it.

108
00:12:09.621 --> 00:12:11.116
May God bless you.
